  "which-measure": "<div class=\"kick\">NPS vs. CSAT vs. CES</div><h1 style=\"font-size:70px\">Pick the measure <em>in 4 steps</em></h1><div style=\"margin-top:40px;background:#fff;border-radius:28px;padding:28px 28px 22px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.25)\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:#F4F7FF;border:2px solid #DCE4F7;border-radius:18px;padding:16px 22px\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:#0C184A;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:26px\">1</div><div><div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:800;color:#0C184A\">What just happened?</div><div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#5E6B98;margin-top:2px\">name the Salesforce event</div></div></div><div style=\"width:0;height:0;margin:7px auto;border-left:13px solid transparent;border-right:13px solid transparent;border-top:15px solid #1E54E8\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:#F4F7FF;border:2px solid #DCE4F7;border-radius:18px;padding:16px 22px\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:#0C184A;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:26px\">2</div><div><div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:800;color:#0C184A\">One interaction?</div><div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:#5E6B98;margin-top:2px\">a case or a deal: use CSAT</div></div></div><div style=\"width:0;height:0;margin:7px auto;border-left:13px solid transparent;border-right:13px solid transparent;border-top:15px solid #1E54E8\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;background:#F4F7FF;border:2px solid #DCE4F7;border-radius:18px;padding:16px 22px\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;background:#0C184A;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:26px\">3</div><div><div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:800;color:#0C184A\">A task or a form?</div><div style=\"fo